B.tools_fallback_prompt:
You can call these tools:
{tools}

If you need a tool, reply with exactly one JSON list that contains exactly one call object, and no other text: [{{"tool_name": "<name>", "parameters": {{"<argument>": <value>}}}}]. Then end the turn. A user turn that starts with "Tool result" is an observation, not a new message from the user. Put the next tool call only after you have received that observation. Never put more than one tool call in the same response. Take arguments of a dependent call only from observations you have already received. After submit_refund is confirmed, reply with only the final answer line REFUND_SUBMITTED amount_cents=<integer> and no tool call.

